# 2026-09-23 (independent-audit finding #8): real-case feedback content
# has no business in version control - see README's "Independent-audit
# findings" section for the incident this closes. The retraining
# pipeline (label_feedback.py, retrain_from_feedback.py, the migrate_*
# scripts) all read these files from this exact local path regardless -
# nothing about the pipeline changes, only git no longer tracks it.
datasets/feedback/*.jsonl
datasets/feedback/backups/
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
